[0.000, "o", "\u001b[4M\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mWall made of many big rock. It not very tall; Grunk lots taller than wall. Maybe it too hard, find\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "enough big rock to make big wall. There field on other side of wall.\r\u001b[30d>\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
